--- !u!114 &149556074
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 149556073}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 83c90e794281e6c45a7e3be79a668332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InteriorDialogueManager
  minigameScene: SpotDifference
  returnScene: WorldMap3
  introLines:
  - speaker: NPC
    text: Ah, good, you're here. I've got two emails from my bank that look almost
      identical.
  - speaker: Player
    text: Almost identical is exactly how these scams work.
  - speaker: NPC
    text: "One must be fake, but I can't tell which \u2014 they both have the logo
      and everything."
  - speaker: Player
    text: Scammers copy the visuals perfectly. The tell is always in the small details.
  - speaker: NPC
    text: Show me what to look for?
  - speaker: Player
    text: Let's go through this one line at a time and find every red flag.
  winLines:
  - speaker: NPC
    text: You found every single difference! I never would have noticed the misspelled
      domain.
  - speaker: Player
    text: That's the one detail scammers hope you skip past.
  - speaker: NPC
    text: I'll read much more carefully from now on.
  - speaker: Player
    text: That's all it takes.
  loseLines:
  - speaker: NPC
    text: I think we missed a couple of those...
  - speaker: Player
    text: They hide them well. Let's look again.
  - speaker: NPC
    text: "Good \u2014 I want to really learn this one."
  npcName: Grandpa Lou
  npcSprite: {fileID: 1273775177420961428, guid: 28063ae66ab36194fa5fb474a368ea34, type: 3}
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 1018488277}
